Subtask 3.2: Configure Compliance Scanning
Step 1: Create compliance scan configuration

# Create compliance-scan.yaml
cat << EOF > compliance-scan.yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: compliance-config
  namespace: stackrox
